#. <CLT 4>だけど、物理室を出た直後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But as soon as we were out of the physics lab...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あっ…！
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid "Ah—!"
msgstr ""

#. …セレスさん？　
#. 保健室で待ってるはずじゃ…？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Celeste? Aren't you supposed to be waiting in the\n"
"nurse's office?"
msgstr ""

#. それが…た、大変なのですわ…
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "S-Something has...come up."
msgstr ""

#. 聞いたぞ。山田が殺されたんだろう…？
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Yeah, I heard. Hifumi is dead, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それだけでは…なくなりました…
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid "Well...that is not all. It is...gone."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　どういう意味…？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What's gone?"
msgstr ""

#. 消えてしまったのです…
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid "It has disappeared..."
msgstr ""

#. 消えた…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Disappeared...?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田君の死体が消えてしまったのです！
msgctxt "0010 | CELES"
msgid "Hifumi's body has disappeared!"
msgstr ""

#. え……？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 何を言ってる…？
#. 死体が消えただと？　そんなバカな事が…！
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What are you talking about? It's disappeared? Don't be\n"
"ridiculous."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0013 | CELES"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …本当なのか？
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

#. 一体…何が起きているというのだ…ッ！？
msgctxt "0015 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "What the heck is happening here...!?"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく保健室に戻るぞッ！！
msgctxt "0016 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Everyone, back to the nurse's office!"
msgstr ""
